msgid "Blockchain Updates"
msgstr "区链更新"

#: ../../04_building-apps/05_node-grpc.md:54
msgid "The BlockchainUpdates API streams block-level events (appends, rollbacks, microblocks) in real time — useful for indexers and services that need to react to chain state as it happens, without polling. It runs on a **separate port, 6881**, from the rest of the gRPC API. [Blockchain Updates](11_blockchain-updates) explains how to enable it, what each update contains and how to consume the stream reliably."
msgstr "BlockchainUpdates API流块级事件(附加,回滚,微块)实时——对于索引器和服务来说非常有用,它们需要随其发生而对链态作出反应,而无需投票.它运行在 **6881号,独立港口** 上,来自gRPCAPI的其余部分.[区链更新](11_blockchain-updates) 解释了如何启用它,每次更新包含什么,以及如何可靠地消耗流."

