msgstr "要立即取消每次开放的订单, `POST /matcher/orderbook/cancel` 取 `{\"sender\": <public key>, \"timestamp\": <ms>, \"signature\": <signature of the public key bytes and the big-endian timestamp>}`."

#: ../../04_building-apps/12_matcher-api.md:97
#, python-brace-format
